on beginSprite me
  [  0] getparam 0 .............................. <me>
  [  2] getobjprop 76 ........................... <me.spriteNum>
  [  5] pusharglist 1 ........................... <me.spriteNum>
  [  7] extcall 6 ............................... <sprite(me.spriteNum)>
  [  9] pushint8 15 ............................. <15>
  [ 12] setobjprop 77 ........................... sprite(me.spriteNum).locZ = 15
  [ 15] ret
end
